{
  "name": "i18n",
  "skill": "team-i18n",
  "description": "Hash-based i18n: client runtime + server routes + on-demand translation + Suggestion Mode",
  "requires": ["GCS_BUCKET_NAME", "an LLM provider (optional, for on-demand /translate)"],
  "copy": [
    {
      "id": "client",
      "from": "runtime/client",
      "to": "client/src/i18n",
      "files": ["hashUtils.js", "i18nUtils.js", "I18nContext.jsx", "I18nText.jsx", "SuggestionMode.jsx", "SuggestionMode.css", "index.js"],
      "optionalFiles": { "AdminTranslationsTab.jsx": "admin-tab" }
    },
    {
      "id": "server",
      "from": "runtime/server",
      "to": "server/i18n",
      "files": ["i18nRoutes.js"]
    },
    {
      "id": "locales",
      "from": "runtime/locales",
      "to": "client/public/locales",
      "files": ["en.json"],
      "seedOnly": true
    }
  ],
  "wiring": [
    "1. Client — wrap the app once (main.jsx):",
    "     import { I18nProvider } from './i18n';  <I18nProvider><App/></I18nProvider>",
    "2. Client — render text: import { I18nText } from './i18n';  <I18nText>Save</I18nText>",
    "3. Client — mount the tool once (inside your auth provider):",
    "     import { SuggestionMode } from './i18n';",
    "     <SuggestionMode canUse={isTeacher()||isAdmin()} getAuthHeaders={()=>({Authorization:`Bearer ${token}`})} />",
    "4. Server — mount the router once (server.js):",
    "     const { createI18nRouter } = require('./i18n/i18nRoutes');",
    "     app.use('/server/i18n', createI18nRouter({ storage, requireTeacher, requireAdmin, llmTranslate, localesFsPath }));",
    "5. Client api.js — add 4 wrappers: submit/get/approve/rejectTranslationSuggestion (see README).",
    "6. Admin (with --admin-tab) — add AdminTranslationsTab as a dashboard tab.",
    "",
    "Activates only when display language != 'en'. Endpoints 503 without GCS."
  ]
}
